        "content": "## Daily Customer Reminder Calls\nToday: Claire does the same routine every working day around 16:00: \u201creminder call (phone)\u201d. That is about 153 tasks a month.\nEstimated time saved: 8.14 hours a month (an estimate; see the report).\nRisk: low - Mistakes only result in an incorrect reminder call time, which can be quickly corrected over the phone.\n\nBefore switching on: set the trigger's credentials, PHONE_API_URL, APPROVAL_WEBHOOK_URL and AI_API_KEY in the n8n environment.",
